## Canned ahelp replies, owned by Hosts and Owners (see Resources/Prototypes/_WG/AHelpTickets/macros.yml).
## $player is the player's character name.

wg-ahelp-macro-looking-name = Looking into it (claim)
wg-ahelp-macro-looking-text = Hey there, let me take a look. One moment.
wg-ahelp-macro-anything-else-name = Anything else?
wg-ahelp-macro-anything-else-text = Is there anything else I can help you with?
wg-ahelp-macro-done-name = All sorted (resolve)
wg-ahelp-macro-done-text = That should be sorted. Enjoy the rest of your round!
wg-ahelp-macro-bug-report-name = Make a bug report (resolve)
wg-ahelp-macro-bug-report-text = That sounds like a bug. Please file a bug report with the green bug button on the top toolbar so the team can fix it. Thanks for letting us know!
wg-ahelp-macro-respawn-name = Respawn approved (respawn, resolve)
wg-ahelp-macro-respawn-text = You're cleared to respawn; I've sent you back to the lobby. Please follow the respawn rules shown when you rejoin.
wg-ahelp-macro-unstick-name = Unstick yourself
wg-ahelp-macro-unstick-text = Press Escape and use the "Unstick me" button. Let me know if that doesn't free you.
wg-ahelp-macro-details-name = Ask for details (claim)
wg-ahelp-macro-details-text = Could you tell me who was involved (names or ships), where it happened and roughly when? Everything you have up front helps.
wg-ahelp-macro-deed-name = Ship deed basics
wg-ahelp-macro-deed-text = Use the ship's deed in hand to claim the ship so it doesn't despawn. To sell, take the ship to a shipyard console and sell it from there.
wg-ahelp-macro-ic-name = In-character matter (IC issue)
wg-ahelp-macro-ic-text = That one's an in-character matter, so it's yours to sort out in character. If anything breaks the rules, send another ahelp.
